description:
Ryan approved on 2026-10-25 ('Yes, start the sponsorship work'). Build the round-3 Claude Design sponsorship spec (Sponsorship.dc.html). Rounded lime units are the only rounded shapes on the site, and every unit says 'Sponsored', carries a diamond mark and names Anthus, so disclosure never relies on colour.

Units:
- sponsor bar: every page, top of the lime band, never sticky, not in email;
- banner;
- sidebar card;
- contextual note;
- feed row.

Matching uses the page's map concepts: decision models to Cyclotron, speech and TTS to Auritus, chat and agents to Chatticus, topic modelling and knowledge to Biblicus, publishing to Papyrus, otherwise the generic Anthus unit.

Density follows the spec table. Units never go inside votes, Proposals, drafts, statuses, evidence, ratings, the map graph or river, citations, the sign-in prompt, or a story's first screen.

Analytics:
- GA4 view_promotion (50% visible for 1 s, once per unit) and select_promotion, with no reader identity;
- rel='sponsored noopener' on every sponsored link;
- UTMs: source shipped, medium sponsored, campaign solution, content unit-pagetype, term topic.

Footer: 'Published by Anthus AI Solutions, which also sponsors it.', plus a 'Sponsorship and independence' section in Policies.

Ships behind a switch in web/sponsorship.json, turned on only after Ryan approves the copy and URLs.
